    "All new-run scores are the best epoch selected by accuracy on the same 872-example official SST-2 validation set. No hidden-label test data were evaluated.",
    "The five pilots use 8192 training examples each. The control and padding-mask runs within each seed have identical training subset indices, architecture, epochs and optimizer settings.",
    "Seed 43 uses dense LCU for control and sparse LCU for masking. The sparse kernel computes the same masked operation and is covered by output/gradient equivalence tests; floating-point ordering can still change optimization trajectories.",
    "Two paired seeds provide a small descriptive comparison, not a statistical significance result or an unbiased test estimate. Both checkpoint and experiment choices reuse the same validation set.",
    "The regularized seed-42 run bundles AdamW with weight decay 0.01, a cosine learning-rate schedule and head dropout 0.1. It does not isolate the effect of any individual change.",
    "The full-data run uses 67349 training rows and batch size 256, while pilots use 8192 rows and batch size 32. It is not a same-budget controlled comparison. The historical checkpoint also used a different architecture/training protocol.",
